<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>ScscriptriPt Blog</title><link>https://scscriptript.github.io/</link><description>Recent content on ScscriptriPt Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-hans</language><copyright>Copyright © 2026 ScscriptriPt. All Rights Reserved.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://scscriptript.github.io/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>停止所谓的“为了你好”</title><link>https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/2026/10/%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%80%E8%B0%93%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD/</link><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://scscriptript.github.io/blog/2026/10/%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E6%89%80%E8%B0%93%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>以前，我跟一些朋友还有联系时，就经常会“送”别人一些有的没的的东西：</p>
<ul>
<li>明信片，工具，软件，甚至某些“积极”的想法，“有用”的內容</li>
<li>可能是别人告知了“谢谢我不喝”，但我还是给他预留了一杯奶茶</li>
<li>是别人声称要减肥，我却说你不胖，太瘦了，不用减</li>
</ul>
<p>“送”往往被美化，而不好听的另一边，这叫做“强迫（Force）”：如果我送了，那你就必须接受。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>More Image Processing Methods</title><link>https://scscriptript.github.io/news/2022/07/more-image-processing-methods/</link><pubDate>Fri, 08 Jul 2022 11:34:47 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://scscriptript.github.io/news/2022/07/more-image-processing-methods/</guid><description>&lt;p>Since &lt;code>v1.0.0-alpha.1&lt;/code>, HBS supports much more image processing methods. Such as Crop, Fit and Fill images. You can also apply filters on an image.&lt;/p></description><enclosure url="https://scscriptript.github.io/news/2022/07/more-image-processing-methods/featured-sample.webp" length="498412" type="image/webp"/></item></channel></rss>